CM_ BO_ 2024 "Logical OBD-II response payloads. The transport/device strips CAN and ISO-TP framing. The library strips response service + PID before applying these signal layouts.";
CM_ SG_ 2024 VIN "Mode 09 PID 02. Payload after 0x49 0x02 includes one information-type/count byte, then 17 ASCII VIN bytes.";

VAL_ 2024 Fuel_Type 0 "Not available" 1 "Gasoline" 2 "Methanol" 3 "Ethanol" 4 "Diesel" 5 "LPG" 6 "CNG" 7 "Propane" 8 "Electric" 9 "Bifuel gasoline" 10 "Bifuel methanol" 11 "Bifuel ethanol" 12 "Bifuel LPG" 13 "Bifuel CNG" 14 "Bifuel propane" 15 "Bifuel electricity" 16 "Bifuel electric/combustion" 17 "Hybrid gasoline" 18 "Hybrid ethanol" 19 "Hybrid diesel" 20 "Hybrid electric" 21 "Hybrid electric/combustion" 22 "Hybrid regenerative" 23 "Bifuel diesel" ;
